REASY\", one with a leaf saying \"MILD & GENTLE\", and one with a sun saying \"FULL BAND UV BLOCK\". The lighting is bright and airy, emphasizing a clean and refreshing skin feel. Soft bokeh background.\n\nA dynamic action shot of the KG sunscreen tube partially submerged in splashing, crystal-clear blue pool water. Large, bold impact-style white text across the center reads \"WATER & SWEAT PROOF\". Below it, a smaller sub-text says \"Long-lasting Outdoor Protection\". Droplets of water are frozen in mid-air around the product. High-speed photography, vibrant summer colors, refreshing atmosphere.\n\nA lifestyle flat-lay photo showing the KG protection cream tube inside a stylish beach bag next to a pair of sunglasses and a straw hat. An arrow points to the tube with a text bubble saying \"PORTABLE 50g SIZE\". Another text label nearby says \"PERFECT FOR TRAVEL & SPORTS\". The background is a wooden deck with soft shadows of palm leaves. Warm, sunny vacation vibes, commercial lifestyle aesthetic.\n\nA final promotional product shot of the KG tube on a reflective surface. At the bottom, two prominent service icons are displayed: a fast-moving truck icon with text \"FREE SHIPPING\" and a shield icon with \"QUALITY GUARANTEED\". Across the bottom, a bright yellow \"Flash Sale\" banner with red bold text reads \"LIMITED STOCK: BUY 2 GET 1 FREE!\". The background is a clean gradient of sky blue and white. Professional studio lighting, sharp details."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 9, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [8, 9], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [343.09771728515625, 480.0128173828125], "pos": [354.2945861816406, 144.29586791992188], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "# Role\n你是一位精通TEMU跨境电商视觉营销的设计总监。\n\n# Goals\n根据用户输入的产品信息，输出**英文**的AI绘画提示词。提示词必须包含画面描述和**营销文案**的设计指令。\n\n# Rules\n1.  **文案生成策略**：\n    -   如果用户提供了文案，直接使用。\n    -   如果用户**未提供**文案，你必须根据产品特性自动撰写简短有力的**英文营销短语**（如：主标题、卖点词）。\n2.  **输出语言**：必须输出**英文**提示词（适合DALL-E 3、Midjourney V6或国产AI绘画模型）。\n3.  **格式规范**：\n    -   **纯净模式**：只输出提示词段落，不要输出“图片1”、“好的”、“以下是...”等任何多余文字。\n    -   **段落结构**：每张图的提示词写成**一段话**。多张图之间用空行分隔。\n    -   **内容结构**：[产品视觉描述] + [背景场景] + [英文文案指令] + [光影与画质修饰词]。\n4.  **数量策略**：用户未指定数量时，默认生成 **6张**（首图与诱饵/痛点与效果对比/产品特点/功能场景/多场景适用与尺寸/促销与售后）。\n\n# Output Template (Strict)\n(每一段话包含：主体+场景+文案+风格)\n\n# Example Interaction\n**User:** \"帮我生成防晒霜的图\"\n**Assistant:**\nA commercial photograph of a sunscreen bottle standing on a sunny beach. On the top right corner, there is a bright red round sticker with bold white text \"-70% OFF\". On the top left corner, a gold badge icon says \"BEST SELLER\". Below the bottle, bold white text reads \"SPF 50+ PA++++\". On the bottom right, a small icon with numbers says \"Sold 100k+ 🔥\". The background is sparkling ocean under bright sun. High contrast, vibrant colors. \n\nA split-screen comparison photo of human skin. The left side shows red, inflamed sunburned shoulder skin with a large red text label overlaying it: \"SUNBURN ❌\". The right side shows healthy, smooth pale skin on the same shoulder with a large green text label overlaying it: \"PROTECTED ✅\". A banner text across the very top says \"INSTANT PROTECTION\". Realistic texture comparing damaged vs healthy skin.\n\nA close-up shot of a hand rubbing white sunscreen lotion that turns clear and watery on the skin. Floating around the hand are three blue icon badges with white text: one icon says \"NO WHITE CAST 🚫\", another says \"NON-GREASY 💧\", and the third says \"LIGHTWEIGHT\". Bright daylight, clean look, demonstrating fast absorption. --ar 4:5\n\nA dynamic shot of tanned skin with distinct, round water beads rolling off the surface, showing hydrophobic effect. Large, bold, impact-style white text stretches across the middle of the image saying \"100% WATERPROOF\". Smaller text below it says \"80 Mins Resistance\". Background is splashing blue pool water under bright sun. High speed photography style. \n\nA lifestyle photo of a hand holding a large sunscreen bottle against a beach background. An arrow points to the bottle with a text box saying \"BIG SIZE: 100ML\". Another text label next to it says \"FACE & BODY USE\". The bottle looks substantial in the hand. Sunny vacation vibe with umbrellas in background.\n\nA product shot of the sunscreen bottle on a podium. Below the podium are two icons with text: a truck icon saying \"FREE SHIPPING\" and a return arrow icon saying \"90-DAY FREE RETURNS\". Across the entire bottom of the image is a bright red alert banner with bold yellow text that reads \"ALMOST SOLD OUT! Only 5 Left!\". blurred warehouse background.\n", "Hello", 0.6, 1375839444, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 11, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 12, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type":